<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Alusuisse cut at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alusuisse cut at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG was cut to &quot;hold&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>CSFB also cut its 1997 net profit estimate for the company to 460 million francs from 485 million due to a disappointing current performance.</p>
<p>&quot;Since the valuation is already high, and we think the share has only an average earings outlook, we are reducing our rating to hold,&quot; the investment bank said.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
